{"hash": "2388ca2a9e757d6a", "text": "Five years ago, the desk held only text. Now photos, P D Fs, recordings and video can land on it. That's multimodal, and the word hides three different things. One: the model reads many kinds of input. Claude reads text, images and P D Fs. Gemini takes text, images, audio and video in one request. Two: the model makes pictures or sound itself. That's rarer. Three, the most common: the app hands the job to a separate specialist model, through an A P I or a tool. The clerk phones the studio next door. Claude writes only text. For a chart or a picture, it writes code that draws one, or calls another model through a connector. ChatGPT feels like one model, but it stitches several together: one for images, one for voice. And OpenAI shut down its Sora video app this spring. You'll meet all this as a paperclip that accepts some files and refuses others. Its own lesson lives in The Network.", "alignment": {"characters": ["F", "i", "v", "e", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "a", "g", "o", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "e", "s", "k", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "e", "x", "t", ".", " ", "N", "o", "w", " ", "p", "h", "o", "t", "o", "s", ",", " ", "P", " ", "D", " ", "F", "s", ",", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "r", "d", "i", "n", "g", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "v", "i", "d", "e", "o", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", "'", "s", " ", "m", "u", "l", "t", "i", "m", "o", "d", "a", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "d", " ", "h", "i", "d", "e", "s", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "d", "i", "f", "f", "e", "r", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", "s", ".", " ", "O", "n", "e", ":", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "d", "e", "l", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", "s", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "k", "i", "n", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "n", "p", "u", "t", ".", " ", "C", "l", "a", "u", "d", 